WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.442
My normal morning:

2
00:00:01.442 --> 00:00:05.086
new jobs in, every match decided, emails ready.

3
00:00:05.086 --> 00:00:05.770
Let's go.

4
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.980
I open up do good talent.

5
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.845
It checks for new contractors and jobs itself.

6
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.799
Home shows where I'm at:

7
00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:15.245
thirty people, six jobs, six matches waiting.

8
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.741
Want to check again now?

9
00:00:17.741 --> 00:00:20.678
Get latest.

10
00:00:20.678 --> 00:00:22.039
One new job came in.

11
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.695
Now the big one:

12
00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:25.618
Find matches for four new jobs.

13
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.478
It reads every job against every contractor.

14
00:00:29.478 --> 00:00:31.571
The bar shows how far it's got.

15
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.728
Done, eighteen matches.

16
00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:34.446
Hit Review.

17
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.842
One person at a time:

18
00:00:37.842 --> 00:00:41.557
fit score, where they live, when they can start, their rate.

19
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:42.835
Yes?

20
00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:45.008
Approve, or just hit one.

21
00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.355
Not sure?

22
00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:49.184
Needs info, hit two.

23
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:51.577
A no?

24
00:00:51.577 --> 00:00:54.473
Reject, hit three, then pick a reason.

25
00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.047
Wrong key?

26
00:00:59.047 --> 00:01:00.991
Undo or Z brings it back.

27
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.473
The rest go quick.

28
00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:05.598
One key each, next person.

29
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.289
All caught up.

30
00:01:07.289 --> 00:01:09.032
Every match is answered.

31
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.434
For anyone I approved, I hit Write the email.

32
00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.981
One for the client, one for the contractor.

33
00:01:16.981 --> 00:01:19.386
Already written, signed with my name.

34
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.721
The app never sends anything.

35
00:01:21.721 --> 00:01:23.901
You copy it, or open it in your email.

36
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.231
And that's my morning:

37
00:01:27.231 --> 00:01:31.046
get latest, find matches, one-two-three, emails.

38
00:01:31.046 --> 00:01:31.435
Done.
